:"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu","html_url":"https://github.com/rahuldesirazu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"rahuldesirazu","id":7719567,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MTk1Njc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7719567?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu","html_url":"https://github.com/rahuldesirazu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rahuldesirazu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2018-05-18T06:44:45Z","updated_at":"2018-06-12T06:32:46Z","closed_at":"2018-06-12T06:32:46Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"A full move operation with RF=3 from nodes {A, B, C} -> {D, E, F} gets stuck. At a high level, this is what is happening:\r\n\r\n1. Spin up three new nodes each with a master and tserver process.\r\n2. The tserver on D heartbeats to master leader on A and sees masters {A, B, C}.\r\n3. Issue a changeConfig to add the master on D to the quorum.\r\n4. Issue a changeConfig to step down the master on A.\r\n5. Master on A steps down as leader, master on D becomes the new leader.\r\n6. The tserver on D heartbeats to what it thinks is the master leader on A, A responds saying its no longer the master leader.\r\n7. The tserver on D round robins trying all the masters it knows {A, B, C}, never finding a leader since D was never advertised.\r\n\r\nAttached are relevant log files from the nodes.\r\n\r\n[logs.tar.gz](https://github.com/YugaByte/yugabyte-db/files/2015744/logs.tar.gz)\r\n\r\nTo fix this issue, the current proposal is to add a code path for follower masters to heartbeat back to tservers with the master quorum. When D then heartbeats to A, A, instead of just saying not the master leader, will say its no longer the master leader, and then advertise the new quorum of {A, B, C, D}.\r\n\r\n ","closed_by":{"login":"bbaddepudi","id":6334739,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMzQ3Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6334739?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi","html_url":"https://github.com/bbaddepudi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbaddepudi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/294/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/294/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}